== Notes ==

* Added in [[patch]] 1.69.
* There are ten of these feats &mdash; player tool 1 to player tool 10.
* These feats appear under the [[base class]] special abilities in the [[radial menu]], which happens to always put them next to the [[horse menu]].
* The intent of these feats is to relieve the reliance upon [[item]]s to give players easy access to certain custom scripts. They also eliminate the activation animation associated with item use. A player can select any of these tools from the radial menu, then select a target (which could be ignored, depending on the implementation), thereby initiating whatever actions the module builder associated with that tool.

== Builder notes ==

'''Item feat:''' yes (intended use)

== Custom content notes ==

'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes (no default behavior)

'''Scripts:''' <code>x3_pl_tool01</code> through <code>x3_pl_tool10</code>